    "text": "The reaction with phenol is carried out the alkaline medium only (i.e., with phenoxide ion). The alkaline medium in 2 is not given. <br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/3bee8953-c928-46a8-aed0-a04ac1d18a45.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:5.45833in;height:0.725in\"> <br/>Here 1, 3 and 4 reactions are possible. <br/><math><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mi></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><msub><mrow><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></mover></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>  <br/><math><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mi></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><msub><mrow><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></mover></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mover accent=\"false\"><mo>→</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N<